      "updated": 1784728523019,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Project Repo/\n\n- Project-Metadata.yaml\n    - Client\n    - Maconomy code\n    - Project type\n    - Location\n    - Time \n    - Coordinate Systems\n\n- Key Members\n    - PrjM\n    - Prj controller\n    - Discipline Leads:\n        - D1: Bob@ramboll.com\n        - D2: Alice@ramboll.com \n    - Digital Support:\n        - olivier@ramboll.com\n        - adrian@ramboll.com\n\n- Data Platforms/ \n    - autodesk-forma.yaml\n        - folder-structure:\n            - 00-Admin\n            - 01-Tender\n            - 02-WIP\n                - Discipline-A\n                - Discipline-B\n            - 03-Shared\n            - 04-Published\n\n        - approuval-workflows?\n        - access-management?\n            - roles:\n                - <RoleXYZ-in-Forma>\n                    - MapsTo: <Organization-01>-<Role-A>\n                    - permissions? (supported? Maybe not, but ok)\n                        - default: ReadOnly\n                        - folder-overrides:\n                            - path: some/path/with/write-access\n                              access: Write\n\n\n    - esri-arcgis.yaml\n        - layer-structure\n        - groups\n        - apps\n\n    - trimble-connnect.yaml\n        - folder-structure:\n            - 00-Admin\n            - 01-Tender\n            - 02-WIP\n                - Discipline-A\n                - Discipline-B\n            - 03-Shared\n            - 04-Published\n\n    - xyz.yaml\n\n- AccessManagement/\n    - ProjectRoles:\n        - <Organization-01>-<Role-A>\n        - <Organization-01>-<Role-B>\n        - <Organization-02>-<Role-A> \n",
      "fontSize": 18.55110744900173,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Project Repo/\n\n- Project-Metadata.yaml\n    - Client\n    - Maconomy code\n    - Project type\n    - Location\n    - Time \n    - Coordinate Systems\n\n- Key Members\n    - PrjM\n    - Prj controller\n    - Discipline Leads:\n        - D1: Bob@ramboll.com\n        - D2: Alice@ramboll.com \n    - Digital Support:\n        - olivier@ramboll.com\n        - adrian@ramboll.com\n\n- Data Platforms/ \n    - autodesk-forma.yaml\n        - folder-structure:\n            - 00-Admin\n            - 01-Tender\n            - 02-WIP\n                - Discipline-A\n                - Discipline-B\n            - 03-Shared\n            - 04-Published\n\n        - approuval-workflows?\n        - access-management?\n            - roles:\n                - <RoleXYZ-in-Forma>\n                    - MapsTo: <Organization-01>-<Role-A>\n                    - permissions? (supported? Maybe not, but ok)\n                        - default: ReadOnly\n                        - folder-overrides:\n                            - path: some/path/with/write-access\n                              access: Write\n\n\n    - esri-arcgis.yaml\n        - layer-structure\n        - groups\n        - apps\n\n    - trimble-connnect.yaml\n        - folder-structure:\n            - 00-Admin\n            - 01-Tender\n            - 02-WIP\n                - Discipline-A\n                - Discipline-B\n            - 03-Shared\n            - 04-Published\n\n    - xyz.yaml\n\n- AccessManagement/\n    - ProjectRoles:\n        - <Organization-01>-<Role-A>\n        - <Organization-01>-<Role-B>\n        - <Organization-02>-<Role-A> \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
