      "text": "Microsoft List to map users to project roles?\n\nThe list:\n- lives under the Project's Teams/SharePoint\n- is read-only, updated by the onboarding tool that goes through the approuval workflow ",
      "fontSize": 16.00000234750601,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Microsoft List to map users to project roles?\n\nThe list:\n- lives under the Project's Teams/SharePoint\n- is read-only, updated by the onboarding tool that goes through the approuval workflow ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
